00:17:32.450 --> 00:17:34.330
I'll let you take the lead.

00:17:34.330 --> 00:17:36.580
Huh? Anya doesn't want to?

00:17:36.580 --> 00:17:38.790
No, no, no... It's all you.

00:17:38.790 --> 00:17:40.790
I think I'll bring up the rear.

00:17:40.790 --> 00:17:43.580
The second in line gets the best value for risk.

00:17:43.580 --> 00:17:44.910
What's this about value?

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:46.290
Please, stop it.

00:17:46.290 --> 00:17:47.870
The front is all yours.

00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:50.540
No! I'm the one guarding the rear!

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:53.620
No, no. I think not.

00:17:53.620 --> 00:17:54.830
Hey...

00:18:00.660 --> 00:18:02.950
What the hell are you doing?

00:18:02.950 --> 00:18:04.870
Eek!

00:18:06.830 --> 00:18:08.870
Stupidly huge...

00:18:08.870 --> 00:18:11.580
What's stupidly huge?!

00:18:11.580 --> 00:18:13.120
You little...!

00:18:17.540 --> 00:18:21.120
Oh, my... That's what you're
gonna be angry about?

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:26.500
Don't run from me!

00:18:47.290 --> 00:18:48.950
Sorry to keep you--

00:18:55.200 --> 00:18:56.540
Huh?

00:19:10.370 --> 00:19:12.540
Well, well...

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:16.700
The viewer count sure is skyrocketing...

00:19:28.080 --> 00:19:29.250
Afro.

00:19:29.250 --> 00:19:30.790
It's me.

00:19:36.160 --> 00:19:36.830
"Sober Shroom"

00:19:36.830 --> 00:19:43.540
"Sober Shroom"
I yelled back at him, but what if there's
actually a mushroom named that?

00:19:43.540 --> 00:19:46.580
"Sober Shroom"
"Keyword 'Sober Shroom'"
"Web Results: 0 Results"
Neigh...

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:48.450
He tricked me!

00:19:50.200 --> 00:19:53.330
Though, I know what a V-neck is...

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:55.870
Does it have another
meaning I'm not aware of?

00:19:55.870 --> 00:19:58.700
"V-neck"
"A V-neck is a shirt with a v-shaped
opening for the neckline."
Neigh...

00:19:58.700 --> 00:20:00.950
I just don't get it!

00:20:06.290 --> 00:20:08.500
"--ground Report
Name: Kaikoku Onigasaki
Birthday: Feb 3
Blood Type: O"

00:20:10.160 --> 00:20:12.540
What kind of data is there on me?

00:20:15.160 --> 00:20:17.540
"Notes
Grandpa Kaiun: Critical Condition"

00:21:11.700 --> 00:21:14.830
Whoa! D-Don't do that!

00:21:19.040 --> 00:21:20.950
Oh, Oshigiri!

00:21:22.410 --> 00:21:23.160
Good mor--

00:21:23.160 --> 00:21:25.160
Is Onigasaki here?!

00:21:25.160 --> 00:21:28.410
I haven't seen him this morning.

00:21:30.120 --> 00:21:33.450
Did something happen?

00:21:33.450 --> 00:21:35.500
He's nowhere to be found.

00:21:35.500 --> 00:21:37.200
He's gone.

00:21:45.660 --> 00:21:48.330
Good morning...

00:21:51.120 --> 00:21:53.700
...Mr. Onigasaki.

00:22:00.160 --> 00:22:02.330
Welcome...

00:22:04.040 --> 00:22:06.620
...to the White Room.
